() Tj
T*
(5. Risk Coverage) Tj
T*
(5.1 Enhanced Risk Capture) Tj
T*
(Basel III strengthens the capital requirements for counterparty credit risk arising from) Tj
T*
(derivatives, repos, and securities financing transactions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5.2 Credit Valuation Adjustment \(CVA\)) Tj
T*
(Banks must hold capital against potential mark-to-market losses on derivatives due to) Tj
T*
(the deterioration in the creditworthiness of counterparties.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Systemically Important Banks) Tj
T*
(6.1 Global Systemically Important Banks \(G-SIBs\)) Tj
T*
(G-SIBs are required to hold additional capital buffers ranging from 1% to 3.5% of) Tj
T*
(risk-weighted assets, depending on their systemic importance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.2 Domestic Systemically Important Banks \(D-SIBs\)) Tj
T*
(National authorities may require D-SIBs to hold additional capital buffers based on) Tj
T*
(their domestic systemic importance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. Output Floor) Tj
T*
(7.1 Standardized Approach Floor) Tj
T*
(Basel III includes an output floor that limits the extent to which banks can use) Tj
T*
(internal models to reduce capital requirements. The floor is set at 72.5% of the) Tj
T*
(standardized approach.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8. Implementation Timeline) Tj
T*
(8.1 Phase-in Arrangements) Tj
T*
(The Basel III standards are being implemented gradually:) Tj
T*
(- Capital requirements: 2013-2019) Tj
T*
(- Leverage ratio: 2018) Tj
T*
(- LCR: 2015) Tj
T*
(- NSFR: 2018) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8.2 Monitoring Period) Tj
T*
(The leverage ratio and liquidity standards were subject to observation periods before) Tj
T*
(becoming minimum requirements.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(9. Regulatory Consistency) Tj
T*
(9.1 Implementation Consistency) Tj
T*
(The Basel Committee monitors the consistency of implementation across jurisdictions to) Tj
T*
(ensure a level playing field and prevent regulatory arbitrage.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(9.2 Jurisdictional Discretion) Tj
T*
(National authorities have limited discretion in implementing Basel III standards,) Tj
T*
(particularly regarding the countercyclical buffer and systemic risk buffers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(10. Impact Assessment) Tj
T*
(10.1 Economic Impact) Tj
ET
endstream
